{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13207420","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13207420","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1320742001:2":{"text":"好、好神奇！只是听着旋律，好像能感受到画面！","source_cn":"好、好神奇！只是听着旋律，好像能感受到画面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC188B7ABCD69053A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320742002:1":{"text":"我好像看见了挥动翅膀的白鸟，在沙漠里奔跑的羚羊……看见了很多我不认识的动物。","source_cn":"我好像看见了挥动翅膀的白鸟，在沙漠里奔跑的羚羊……看见...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AAA5B0ABDC1A3A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320742003:1":{"text":"它们在飞，在跳，在打闹……","source_cn":"它们在飞，在跳，在打闹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x363FB161883E9F0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320742004:1":{"text":"我想摸摸他们……想到他们身边去。","source_cn":"我想摸摸他们……想到他们身边去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A2FE0A8628801C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320742005:1":{"text":"巴维尔……你可以的！但是你要安心治疗，如果连医生给的药都不吃，你又怎么能恢复呢？","source_cn":"巴维尔……你可以的！但是你要安心治疗，如果连医生给的药...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39CDFFCB94424DA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320742006:1":{"text":"我真的能恢复吗……我听说，这种病很难恢复……我已经瞎了。","source_cn":"我真的能恢复吗……我听说，这种病很难恢复……我已经瞎了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C821673678ED2AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320742007:1":{"text":"你现在也能看见，不是吗？决定你能否看见风景的，不是你的眼睛，而是你的心。","source_cn":"你现在也能看见，不是吗？决定你能否看见风景的，不是你的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x494051649F1DFF60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320742008:1":{"text":"用你的心，相信你的眼睛。你一定可以再次踏上冒险的旅途。","source_cn":"用你的心，相信你的眼睛。你一定可以再次踏上冒险的旅途。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1A9B993847E4B5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320742009:1":{"text":"我的心……","source_cn":"我的心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40F69226D0C82D9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320742010:1":{"text":"我知道了，我会试着相信它！","source_cn":"我知道了，我会试着相信它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95ACEB44A60B2EE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320742011:1":{"text":"洛桑哥哥，谢谢你！","source_cn":"洛桑哥哥，谢谢你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0BB98AD85085